ps":335,"conservation":55,"weights":336,"heroTitle":329,"heroTitleHtml":338,"heroJarImage":339,"heroLabelImage":342,"mainImage":31,"labelledJarImage":31,"sliderPreview":344,"fruitSvg":347,"fruitSvgMarkup":348,"unlabelledJarImage":31,"gallery":349,"pairings":356,"themeColor":126,"seo":357,"isFeatured":92,"sortOrder":362,"alternateUids":363},"cipolla","Sweet and Sour Onions",{"html":331,"text":332},"<p>Soft, fragrant, and perfectly balanced between sweet and tangy. The natural sweetness of onion meets the lively note of vinegar in a great classic of the Mediterranean tradition.</p><p>Ingredients: onions (76%), extra virgin olive oil, <strong>pine nuts</strong>, salt, sultana raisins, balsamic vinegar, white wine vinegar <strong>(contains sulfites)</strong>, fresh mint, sugar.</p>","Soft, fragrant, and perfectly balanced between sweet and tangy. The natural sweetness of onion meets the lively note of vinegar in a great classic of the Mediterranean tradition. Ingredients: onions (76%), extra virgin olive oil, pine nuts, salt, sultana raisins, balsamic vinegar, white wine vinegar (contains sulfites), fresh mint, sugar.",{"html":334,"text":181},"<p>May contain: gluten, soy, sesame, other tree nuts, lupins, peanuts</p>","Ideal for pairing with cured meat and cheese boards, focaccia, pizza, and bruschetta. Keep away from direct sunlight. After opening, store in the refrigerator and consume within 3–4 days.",{"label":8,"items":337},[58,59,60],"Sweet and <br>Sour Onions",{"url":340,"alt":341,"width":65,"height":66},"/assets/images.prismic.io/agrumea-site/ahvhdQeQX7-eWdI3_cipolla_result.webp?auto=format,compress","Agrumea Farm - Sweet and Sour Onions",{"url":343,"alt":341,"width":66,"height":69},"/assets/images.prismic.io/agrumea-site/ahvhdgeQX7-eWdI4_cipolla-in-agrodolce_result.webp?auto=format,compress",{"url":345,"alt":346,"width":72,"height":73},"/assets/images.prismic.io/agrumea-site/aiRFeQeQX7-eW8Kx_cipollsa_result.webp?auto=format,compress&rect=1,0,734,962&w=367&h=481",